1
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:12,630
♪Wealth fades away, fame fades away♪

2
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:16,790
♪All worldly pursuits
are fleeting dreams♪

3
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,350
♪Sorrow fades away,
resentment fades away♪

4
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:22,870
♪Anger and grudges are
but passing clouds♪

5
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:26,640
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

6
00:00:26,730 --> 00:00:30,150
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

7
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:37,230
♪This humble monk wanders freely
across the land♪

8
00:00:38,160 --> 00:00:40,430
♪Laughing and fooling around,
yet bound by karma's law♪

9
00:00:41,240 --> 00:00:43,950
♪People spend their lives chasing
fortune and fearing misfortune♪

10
00:00:44,640 --> 00:00:47,110
♪Yet in a blink, all return to dust♪

11
00:00:47,920 --> 00:00:50,230
♪They scheme endlessly in pursuit
of wealth and glory♪

12
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:53,580
♪But in the end, all things
simply pass by♪

13
00:00:54,440 --> 00:00:57,350
♪Better to follow the heart
and find true joy♪

14
00:00:57,640 --> 00:01:00,550
♪Don't let worldly troubles
bind your soul♪

15
00:01:00,880 --> 00:01:02,190
♪Walk on, walk on♪

16
00:01:02,560 --> 00:01:03,870
♪Roam on, roam on♪

17
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:07,430
♪With my worn-out fan in hand,
I care not for worldly woes♪

18
00:01:07,440 --> 00:01:08,750
♪Drink some wine♪

19
00:01:09,120 --> 00:01:10,510
♪Sail the rivers wide♪

20
00:01:10,520 --> 00:01:13,910
♪Simple robes and straw sandals
beat fine silk and fur♪

21
00:01:13,920 --> 00:01:17,070
♪Laugh at my carefree ways, a simple
fan is all I need to chase worries away♪

22
00:01:17,080 --> 00:01:20,470
♪Laugh at my shabby look, a half pot
of wine carries me through the years♪

23
00:01:20,480 --> 00:01:23,750
♪Wine and meat may pass through me,
but kindness stays in my heart♪

24
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:27,030
♪I cling not to appearances,
finding freedom through Zen's wisdom♪

25
00:01:27,040 --> 00:01:29,070
♪I travel north and south,
witnessing the world's endless tales♪

26
00:01:29,880 --> 00:01:32,540
♪I see life's joys and sorrows
in a single glance♪

27
00:01:33,080 --> 00:01:36,150
♪Those who harm the good and abuse
their power will face their reckoning♪

28
00:01:36,160 --> 00:01:39,630
♪Do good and cultivate virtue,
and worries will fade away♪

29
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:41,990
♪Don't frown over gains and losses♪

30
00:01:42,240 --> 00:01:45,750
♪True cultivation lies
in a joyful heart♪

31
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:48,870
♪Let right and wrong, love and hatred
drift away with the wind♪

32
00:01:48,880 --> 00:01:52,990
♪Live freely and wander this world
without restraint♪

33
00:01:53,780 --> 00:01:56,380
=The Mad Monk: Subdue Demons of Dragon's Fall=
=Episode 1=

34
00:04:06,540 --> 00:04:07,700
You Three-Eyed Monster!

35
00:04:07,700 --> 00:04:09,260
Just you wait!

36
00:04:42,860 --> 00:04:43,780
Reporting!

37
00:04:43,780 --> 00:04:46,100
We have wiped out the entire fox clan.

38
00:04:46,100 --> 00:04:46,540
Good.

39
00:04:46,980 --> 00:04:47,900
Keep the music playing.

40
00:04:48,180 --> 00:04:49,100
Keep dancing.

41
00:05:05,700 --> 00:05:08,700
(One thousand years later)

42
00:05:12,940 --> 00:05:13,900
(Mahavira Hall)
Dear devotees,

43
00:05:13,900 --> 00:05:15,140
today, the Buddha has answered
our prayers.

44
00:05:15,140 --> 00:05:16,100
Your wishes shall be granted.

45
00:05:16,100 --> 00:05:17,780
- Please line up in order.
- (Me! Me!)

46
00:05:17,780 --> 00:05:19,800
Please enter the hall according
to the numbers you've received.

47
00:05:19,800 --> 00:05:20,900
Then you may pay your respects inside.

48
00:05:21,380 --> 00:05:22,620
(One hundred taels)
I'll pay one hundred taels

49
00:05:23,580 --> 00:05:24,820
for the first incense offering.

50
00:05:25,780 --> 00:05:26,740
That much money?

51
00:05:26,740 --> 00:05:27,340
One hundred taels...

52
00:05:27,340 --> 00:05:28,020
Unbelievable!

53
00:05:28,220 --> 00:05:29,580
A VIP guest!

54
00:05:35,420 --> 00:05:36,700
Oh, Buddha above,

55
00:05:36,900 --> 00:05:38,580
my son is twenty-six years old,

56
00:05:38,700 --> 00:05:40,860
yet he still has no children.

57
00:05:41,580 --> 00:05:43,260
I beg the Buddha to show mercy

58
00:05:44,100 --> 00:05:45,540
and bless my Huang family

59
00:05:45,860 --> 00:05:47,460
with an heir.

60
00:05:47,740 --> 00:05:49,220
(The Buddha is compassionate.)

61
00:05:49,220 --> 00:05:50,580
(Sincerity brings blessings.)

62
00:05:50,580 --> 00:05:51,740
The Buddha has answered!

63
00:05:51,740 --> 00:05:52,300
Ah!

64
00:05:52,700 --> 00:05:53,540
Oh my!

65
00:05:53,820 --> 00:05:54,660
Devotee,

66
00:05:54,980 --> 00:05:56,020
the greater your devotion,

67
00:05:56,260 --> 00:05:58,460
the greater your hopes.

68
00:06:00,900 --> 00:06:01,260
More...

69
00:06:11,900 --> 00:06:15,940
(Mr. Huang, would your family like
a daughter?)

70
00:06:16,260 --> 00:06:16,900
Mmm-hmm.

71
00:06:19,860 --> 00:06:20,780
Buddha,

72
00:06:20,780 --> 00:06:21,500
since

73
00:06:21,860 --> 00:06:24,380
you are willing to bless our family
with a daughter,

74
00:06:24,780 --> 00:06:25,620
why not

75
00:06:25,860 --> 00:06:28,260
bless us with triplets?

76
00:06:28,580 --> 00:06:29,740
Thank you, Buddha!

77
00:06:29,940 --> 00:06:31,620
Thank you, Buddha!

78
00:06:31,620 --> 00:06:33,220
(The Buddha is compassionate.)

79
00:06:33,220 --> 00:06:35,020
(More offerings required.)

80
00:06:35,020 --> 00:06:35,540
More...

81
00:06:35,700 --> 00:06:36,260
money.

82
00:06:36,660 --> 00:06:37,220
More.

83
00:06:39,740 --> 00:06:42,540
Your hopes will be greater.

84
00:06:52,980 --> 00:06:53,700
Next one,

85
00:06:53,940 --> 00:06:54,820
please.

86
00:06:55,140 --> 00:06:56,220
(Bold monk!)

87
00:06:56,220 --> 00:06:58,900
(How dare you impersonate me
and swindle people out of their money!)

88
00:07:00,180 --> 00:07:02,420
Please forgive me, Buddha!

89
00:07:03,500 --> 00:07:04,780
No, no!

90
00:07:04,780 --> 00:07:06,180
Lord Buddha, this has nothing
to do with me!

91
00:07:06,180 --> 00:07:07,020
It wasn't me!

92
00:07:07,020 --> 00:07:08,220
I had nothing to do with it!

93
00:07:08,220 --> 00:07:10,260
It was all Master Guangliang's idea!

94
00:07:10,260 --> 00:07:12,340
You... you...

95
00:07:12,340 --> 00:07:13,220
You...

96
00:07:13,220 --> 00:07:14,820
You have no loyalty!

97
00:07:14,820 --> 00:07:16,060
No loyalty at all!

98
00:07:16,060 --> 00:07:17,380
Please calm down, Lord Buddha.

99
00:07:17,380 --> 00:07:18,580
Daoji and I are as close as brothers.

100
00:07:18,580 --> 00:07:20,140
Please spare me

101
00:07:20,140 --> 00:07:21,260
for Daoji's sake.

102
00:07:21,260 --> 00:07:23,100
I swear I'll never do it again.

103
00:07:25,740 --> 00:07:26,580
Good boy.

104
00:07:27,980 --> 00:07:29,060
Since you know your mistake,

105
00:07:29,060 --> 00:07:29,820
I'll spare your life.

106
00:07:31,100 --> 00:07:32,340
Master, it was him!

107
00:07:32,740 --> 00:07:33,620
You again?

108
00:07:34,340 --> 00:07:35,100
Alas.

109
00:07:35,980 --> 00:07:38,220
You've all been fooled by that fat monk.

110
00:07:39,060 --> 00:07:40,140
Get up, get up.

111
00:07:40,380 --> 00:07:41,580
Come on, everyone, leave.

112
00:07:42,100 --> 00:07:43,380
Go on, go on.

113
00:07:44,620 --> 00:07:45,660
Fine, you can prank me all you want.

114
00:07:45,660 --> 00:07:48,180
But you even had them all chase away!

115
00:07:49,420 --> 00:07:50,220
You...

116
00:07:50,460 --> 00:07:51,140
Come here.

117
00:07:55,020 --> 00:07:55,620
Oh.

118
00:07:55,700 --> 00:07:56,460
Well done.

119
00:07:56,580 --> 00:07:57,340
Well done.

120
00:07:59,740 --> 00:08:02,060
Actually, I was helping you.

121
00:08:02,460 --> 00:08:04,180
You took 1,500 taels from him.

122
00:08:04,180 --> 00:08:05,300
Do you really think you could help him

123
00:08:05,300 --> 00:08:06,900
have triplets?

124
00:08:06,900 --> 00:08:07,940
Of...

125
00:08:07,940 --> 00:08:08,660
course...

126
00:08:09,100 --> 00:08:09,780
What?

127
00:08:10,380 --> 00:08:11,780
I was just this close.

128
00:08:12,740 --> 00:08:13,580
But hey!

129
00:08:13,740 --> 00:08:14,140
Huh?

130
00:08:14,380 --> 00:08:16,380
Aren't you the reincarnation
of the Dragon-Subduing Arhat?

131
00:08:16,580 --> 00:08:18,340
Just go talk to the King Yama.

132
00:08:19,220 --> 00:08:21,020
Can't you just get him three babies?

133
00:08:21,020 --> 00:08:21,980
Yeah, yeah, exactly.

134
00:08:21,980 --> 00:08:24,180
But Mr. Huang's son prefers men.

135
00:08:24,580 --> 00:08:25,900
How's he supposed to have children?

136
00:08:25,900 --> 00:08:26,700
Oh my...

137
00:08:28,780 --> 00:08:29,260
Wait, that's right.

138
00:08:29,980 --> 00:08:30,420
What?

139
00:08:30,420 --> 00:08:32,220
You're an immortal with magic powers.

140
00:08:32,740 --> 00:08:34,740
You could make a man pregnant.

141
00:08:35,340 --> 00:08:36,620
You can do that, can't you?

142
00:08:36,620 --> 00:08:37,900
Of course I can.

143
00:08:37,900 --> 00:08:38,820
Since you want children so badly,

144
00:08:38,820 --> 00:08:39,940
I'll let you have one!

145
00:08:44,100 --> 00:08:45,900
He is really having a baby!

146
00:08:46,460 --> 00:08:47,500
He's really going to have a baby!

147
00:08:49,500 --> 00:08:50,940
Quick, get a midwife!

148
00:08:50,940 --> 00:08:52,540
- Go find a midwife!
- (Hurry, hurry!)

149
00:08:53,180 --> 00:08:53,700
Go!

150
00:08:53,700 --> 00:08:55,100
Master Guangliang, why don't you
have a few more?

151
00:08:55,100 --> 00:08:56,340
We could make a fortune!

152
00:08:56,860 --> 00:08:57,620
Make a fortune? My foot!

153
00:08:57,620 --> 00:08:58,540
We'll be rich!

154
00:09:02,060 --> 00:09:03,820
I do everything for Lingyin Temple.

155
00:09:03,820 --> 00:09:05,340
Why do you keep making fun of me?

156
00:09:05,340 --> 00:09:07,100
The temple is barely scraping by.

157
00:09:07,100 --> 00:09:08,140
If you don't want to help, fine.

158
00:09:08,140 --> 00:09:09,020
But you still make a fool of me!

159
00:09:09,020 --> 00:09:11,020
My life is so miserable!

160
00:09:11,020 --> 00:09:11,700
Oh, dear...

161
00:09:11,700 --> 00:09:13,020
Mali mali hong!

162
00:09:14,460 --> 00:09:15,860
Master.

163
00:09:15,860 --> 00:09:16,780
Stop acting.

164
00:09:16,780 --> 00:09:17,420
It's gone.

165
00:09:17,580 --> 00:09:18,140
It's gone?

166
00:09:18,300 --> 00:09:19,140
It's fine.

167
00:09:19,940 --> 00:09:20,900
It disappeared just like that?

168
00:09:21,220 --> 00:09:21,540
Hey.

169
00:09:21,540 --> 00:09:22,620
Listen.

170
00:09:22,780 --> 00:09:24,540
Even if our temple is struggling
financially,

171
00:09:24,540 --> 00:09:25,740
we can't trick people.

172
00:09:26,100 --> 00:09:27,180
We can ask the abbot

173
00:09:27,180 --> 00:09:29,540
to take us down the mountain
to collect alms. Right?

174
00:09:29,540 --> 00:09:30,420
Oh, wow.

175
00:09:30,780 --> 00:09:32,300
You have the nerve to say that.

176
00:09:32,300 --> 00:09:33,180
It was because of you last time.

177
00:09:33,180 --> 00:09:34,420
You made Master Yuantong

178
00:09:34,420 --> 00:09:35,900
become the abbot.

179
00:09:35,900 --> 00:09:37,100
He can't do anything.

180
00:09:37,100 --> 00:09:37,900
His eyesight is bad,

181
00:09:37,900 --> 00:09:38,500
he can barely hear,

182
00:09:38,500 --> 00:09:39,340
and all he does is eat.

183
00:09:39,340 --> 00:09:41,020
He's eaten Lingyin Temple
out of everything.

184
00:09:41,020 --> 00:09:41,820
He's eaten it all away.

185
00:09:41,820 --> 00:09:42,420
Hmm.

186
00:09:42,820 --> 00:09:43,900
Who said I was deaf?

187
00:09:51,940 --> 00:09:52,900
The thing I hate most is people

188
00:09:52,900 --> 00:09:53,860
talking behind my back!

189
00:09:54,980 --> 00:09:55,380
Daoji.

190
00:09:55,500 --> 00:09:55,850
Yes?

191
00:09:55,860 --> 00:09:56,500
Starting tomorrow,

192
00:09:56,780 --> 00:09:57,420
you will be

193
00:09:57,820 --> 00:09:58,860
the temple overseer of Lingyin Temple.

194
00:09:58,940 --> 00:10:00,100
Me?

195
00:10:00,100 --> 00:10:00,780
Huh?

196
00:10:00,940 --> 00:10:02,050
How could Master Daoji

197
00:10:02,050 --> 00:10:03,340
possibly look like a temple overseer?

198
00:10:03,660 --> 00:10:04,500
He's always acting crazy.

199
00:10:04,500 --> 00:10:04,860
Hey!

200
00:10:05,060 --> 00:10:05,420
Hey!

201
00:10:05,420 --> 00:10:07,060
I can defeat demons and evil spirits
with ease.

202
00:10:07,060 --> 00:10:08,780
How could a little temple position
stop me?

203
00:10:08,940 --> 00:10:09,700
Ridiculous!

204
00:10:09,700 --> 00:10:10,540
Fine!

205
00:10:11,540 --> 00:10:13,380
I'll give you my position as overseer.

206
00:10:13,380 --> 00:10:14,340
Thank you!

207
00:10:14,700 --> 00:10:15,860
Master, how could you...

208
00:10:15,860 --> 00:10:16,700
- Hey!
- Master!

209
00:10:17,700 --> 00:10:18,940
Daoji acts crazy

210
00:10:18,940 --> 00:10:19,700
and refuses to follow orders.

211
00:10:19,700 --> 00:10:21,660
Once he turns Lingyin Temple
upside down,

212
00:10:21,660 --> 00:10:23,140
everyone will see how capable I am.

213
00:10:23,140 --> 00:10:24,180
Then everyone

214
00:10:24,180 --> 00:10:25,820
will beg me to come back as overseer.

215
00:10:25,820 --> 00:10:26,900
What did he say?

216
00:10:26,900 --> 00:10:27,660
Hmm.

217
00:10:29,380 --> 00:10:30,580
Are you two done talking?

218
00:10:30,580 --> 00:10:31,460
Yes, we're done.

219
00:10:31,660 --> 00:10:32,300
You...

220
00:10:32,580 --> 00:10:33,140
What?

221
00:10:33,460 --> 00:10:34,500
Starting today,

222
00:10:34,580 --> 00:10:35,300
the first thing you do

223
00:10:35,300 --> 00:10:37,420
is to solve Lingyin Temple's
food problem.

224
00:10:37,420 --> 00:10:38,340
No problem.

225
00:10:38,340 --> 00:10:39,220
Leave it all to me.

226
00:10:39,220 --> 00:10:39,820
And...

227
00:10:39,900 --> 00:10:40,620
And?

228
00:10:40,620 --> 00:10:41,580
Now that you're the temple overseer,

229
00:10:41,580 --> 00:10:42,780
you must set an example.

230
00:10:42,780 --> 00:10:43,580
Starting today,

231
00:10:43,580 --> 00:10:44,420
no more meat.

232
00:10:44,420 --> 00:10:45,260
No more alcohol.

233
00:10:45,260 --> 00:10:45,940
Can you do that?

234
00:10:45,940 --> 00:10:48,140
Can you make that challenge
a little harder?

235
00:10:48,380 --> 00:10:49,420
That's way too easy.

236
00:10:49,580 --> 00:10:49,940
Fine.

237
00:10:50,140 --> 00:10:51,340
I swear right now,

238
00:10:51,460 --> 00:10:52,420
from this day forward,

239
00:10:52,420 --> 00:10:54,340
if I ever drink wine or eat meat again,

240
00:10:54,340 --> 00:10:55,060
then let me be

241
00:10:55,500 --> 00:10:56,780
struck down by heavenly lightning!

242
00:10:59,060 --> 00:10:59,700
Master!

243
00:10:59,700 --> 00:11:00,260
Holy Monk!

244
00:11:00,260 --> 00:11:01,420
Oh my!

245
00:11:01,980 --> 00:11:02,860
Master!

246
00:11:03,500 --> 00:11:05,220
Master!

247
00:11:05,220 --> 00:11:06,460
(Fortune Telling
Blessings for a Bountiful Harvest)

248
00:11:21,660 --> 00:11:22,460
I'm still five taels short.

249
00:11:27,820 --> 00:11:28,620
The time has come.

250
00:11:29,180 --> 00:11:29,600
I must gather

251
00:11:29,600 --> 00:11:31,060
fifty taels of silver
to propose marriage.

252
00:11:31,940 --> 00:11:32,660
(Immortal!)

253
00:11:33,820 --> 00:11:34,940
(Please save me!)

254
00:11:35,380 --> 00:11:36,660
A freshly caught fox!

255
00:11:36,660 --> 00:11:37,980
Come take a look!

256
00:11:37,980 --> 00:11:39,020
Don't miss it!

257
00:11:39,020 --> 00:11:39,980
Hey, guys.

258
00:11:41,740 --> 00:11:42,740
Do you want this fox?

259
00:11:45,380 --> 00:11:45,700
Wait...

260
00:11:46,380 --> 00:11:47,260
Forty-five taels.

261
00:11:47,820 --> 00:11:48,340
Perfect.

262
00:11:48,900 --> 00:11:49,300
Huh?

263
00:11:50,700 --> 00:11:51,180
Hey!

264
00:11:52,580 --> 00:11:53,820
What a fool.

265
00:12:16,980 --> 00:12:17,700
Run for your life.

266
00:12:24,660 --> 00:12:25,180
(One day,)

267
00:12:25,540 --> 00:12:27,140
(I will repay his kindness.)

268
00:12:34,180 --> 00:12:34,620
Oh dear!

269
00:12:35,740 --> 00:12:37,020
Now all my money is gone.

270
00:12:37,020 --> 00:12:38,180
How am I supposed to propose now?

271
00:12:39,020 --> 00:12:39,780
Oh...

272
00:12:42,740 --> 00:12:43,340
Ah!

273
00:12:44,180 --> 00:12:44,700
I've got it!

274
00:13:12,060 --> 00:13:12,620
(Xuanyuan Tomb)

275
00:13:21,140 --> 00:13:22,980
A thousand years have passed.

276
00:13:23,380 --> 00:13:26,700
No member of the fox clan
has ever entered this place.

277
00:13:37,540 --> 00:13:40,140
My fox clan has been sealed
within Xuanyuan Tomb

278
00:13:40,540 --> 00:13:41,980
for a thousand years.

279
00:13:42,980 --> 00:13:44,660
Today, our clan

280
00:13:44,660 --> 00:13:46,700
will help you take human form

281
00:13:46,700 --> 00:13:48,740
and grant you the fox clan's magic.

282
00:13:57,500 --> 00:13:59,980
You must find the Three-Headed Jiao

283
00:13:59,980 --> 00:14:01,660
and help him transform
into a true dragon

284
00:14:01,780 --> 00:14:03,540
to rule the Three Realms.

285
00:14:03,940 --> 00:14:04,900
Then,

286
00:14:05,380 --> 00:14:08,540
the fox clan shall return
to the mortal world.

287
00:14:09,500 --> 00:14:11,340
I will not fail our clan's expectations.

288
00:14:12,660 --> 00:14:14,980
When I see the light of day again,

289
00:14:14,980 --> 00:14:16,860
I will slaughter the Three Realms

290
00:14:16,860 --> 00:14:19,380
and settle a thousand years of grudges.

291
00:14:21,340 --> 00:14:22,260
Master!

292
00:14:23,300 --> 00:14:23,900
Master!

293
00:14:26,460 --> 00:14:27,060
Holy Monk!

294
00:14:27,540 --> 00:14:28,140
Master!

295
00:14:28,700 --> 00:14:29,740
Are you all right?

296
00:14:33,340 --> 00:14:35,460
No one gave me mouth-to-mouth, right?

297
00:14:41,220 --> 00:14:42,540
Ugh!

298
00:14:43,020 --> 00:14:44,540
Help me up!

299
00:14:49,220 --> 00:14:50,140
Oh...

300
00:14:50,660 --> 00:14:51,580
Ah...

301
00:14:51,580 --> 00:14:52,660
Overseer.

302
00:14:52,660 --> 00:14:53,340
Here.

303
00:14:53,340 --> 00:14:53,980
Huh?

304
00:14:54,900 --> 00:14:55,660
What's this?

305
00:14:55,860 --> 00:14:56,540
The accounts...

306
00:14:56,540 --> 00:14:57,460
The account book.

307
00:14:57,460 --> 00:14:59,180
These are Lingyin Temple's accounts.

308
00:14:59,180 --> 00:15:01,100
Lingyin Temple's monthly expenses

309
00:15:01,100 --> 00:15:03,980
come to about five hundred taels.

310
00:15:04,260 --> 00:15:05,020
It's all yours now.

311
00:15:05,020 --> 00:15:06,460
Five...

312
00:15:06,460 --> 00:15:07,180
Five hundred taels?

313
00:15:07,660 --> 00:15:09,420
Where is my master supposed
to get that much money?

314
00:15:09,420 --> 00:15:10,300
Hah!

315
00:15:10,740 --> 00:15:11,620
I'm not telling you.

316
00:15:12,020 --> 00:15:13,260
- You...
- (Help!)

317
00:15:13,260 --> 00:15:14,260
(Monster!)

318
00:15:14,260 --> 00:15:15,260
- Your turn this time.
- (Help!)

319
00:15:15,820 --> 00:15:16,540
Hah!

320
00:15:16,700 --> 00:15:17,740
Five hundred taels

321
00:15:17,740 --> 00:15:18,500
is coming!

322
00:15:19,780 --> 00:15:20,420
Huh?

323
00:15:20,620 --> 00:15:21,860
What demon costs five hundred taels?

324
00:15:22,220 --> 00:15:22,860
Oh.

325
00:15:23,900 --> 00:15:24,820
Let's go!

326
00:15:24,820 --> 00:15:25,580
Five hundred taels?

327
00:15:26,860 --> 00:15:28,300
That's what happened.

328
00:15:28,300 --> 00:15:29,740
So, according to you,

329
00:15:29,900 --> 00:15:31,660
your master celebrated
the birth of a daughter,

330
00:15:31,660 --> 00:15:33,260
when suddenly some madman showed up

331
00:15:33,460 --> 00:15:34,420
with a debt note,

332
00:15:34,420 --> 00:15:36,740
demanding to marry
your newborn daughter.

333
00:15:36,980 --> 00:15:38,220
Your mistress refused,

334
00:15:38,220 --> 00:15:40,100
and this madman turned into a demon

335
00:15:40,100 --> 00:15:42,060
and tried to steal the baby away.

336
00:15:42,060 --> 00:15:43,460
Stealing a child wasn't bad enough,

337
00:15:43,460 --> 00:15:44,180
he even did it on credit.

338
00:15:44,180 --> 00:15:44,780
Absolutely...

339
00:15:44,780 --> 00:15:46,300
Heartless and shameless.

340
00:15:46,300 --> 00:15:46,900
Unbelievable!

341
00:15:46,900 --> 00:15:47,820
Here we are.

342
00:15:48,140 --> 00:15:48,740
Oh.

343
00:15:50,640 --> 00:15:51,360
(Chen Residence)

344
00:15:52,540 --> 00:15:52,980
Hey!

345
00:15:53,260 --> 00:15:53,700
Demon!

346
00:15:54,180 --> 00:15:55,620
Come out right now!

347
00:16:01,980 --> 00:16:02,780
Who are you?

348
00:16:04,700 --> 00:16:05,980
We are...

349
00:16:05,980 --> 00:16:08,740
The new Lingyin Temple team.

350
00:16:11,740 --> 00:16:12,420
No idea.

351
00:16:13,220 --> 00:16:13,900
Who are you then?

352
00:16:13,900 --> 00:16:14,820
What are you?

353
00:16:16,260 --> 00:16:18,060
(Chen Residence)
I am the Three-Headed Jiao King.

354
00:16:28,300 --> 00:16:31,350
♪My shoes are worn, my hat is torn♪

355
00:16:31,700 --> 00:16:34,550
♪Even my monk's robe is tattered♪

356
00:16:34,680 --> 00:16:38,350
♪Everything I own is worn and weathered♪

357
00:16:38,360 --> 00:16:41,430
♪Yet I laugh and live free as can be♪

358
00:16:41,840 --> 00:16:48,590
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

359
00:16:48,600 --> 00:16:52,150
♪With Buddha dwelling in my heart♪

360
00:16:58,840 --> 00:17:02,070
♪Once, I was known as Li Xiuyuan♪

361
00:17:02,080 --> 00:17:05,310
♪Now I bear the name Ji Dian♪

362
00:17:05,600 --> 00:17:08,630
♪After the wedding,
I became an immortal♪

363
00:17:08,640 --> 00:17:10,310
♪I thought of the Arhat
who subdued the tiger♪

364
00:17:10,320 --> 00:17:12,230
♪And there he was, right by my side,
oh my♪

365
00:17:12,240 --> 00:17:13,790
♪I left my wife behind♪

366
00:17:13,960 --> 00:17:15,390
♪And headed straight to Lingyin Temple♪

367
00:17:15,400 --> 00:17:19,230
♪Living a life of hiding here
and running there♪

368
00:17:19,240 --> 00:17:20,350
♪As long as thunder doesn't strike♪

369
00:17:20,360 --> 00:17:22,470
♪I still dare to make a solemn vow♪

370
00:17:22,480 --> 00:17:24,150
♪With me around, nothing can go wrong♪

371
00:17:24,160 --> 00:17:26,030
♪Waiter, bring me a plate
of chicken wings♪

372
00:17:26,040 --> 00:17:29,390
♪People laugh and say I'm lost
and foolish♪

373
00:17:29,400 --> 00:17:32,670
♪Guangliang always nags and scolds me♪

374
00:17:32,880 --> 00:17:35,790
♪His endless lectures come
from worry I'll cause trouble♪

375
00:17:35,800 --> 00:17:39,150
♪I say Buddha lives within my heart♪

376
00:17:39,160 --> 00:17:42,830
♪Wine and meat may pass through my body♪

377
00:17:42,840 --> 00:17:46,190
♪I wander around, I stroll along♪

378
00:17:46,200 --> 00:17:49,270
♪Leaving all my worries behind♪

379
00:17:49,840 --> 00:17:52,910
♪Take a sip, take a bite♪

380
00:17:52,920 --> 00:17:56,350
♪I don't overthink this life of mine♪

381
00:17:56,360 --> 00:17:59,910
♪You chase fame and fight
over fortune and fate♪

382
00:17:59,920 --> 00:18:03,390
♪You're just wasting your time♪

383
00:18:03,400 --> 00:18:06,350
♪They all call me a Living Buddha♪

384
00:18:06,360 --> 00:18:08,030
♪And I just laugh happily♪

385
00:18:08,040 --> 00:18:11,430
♪Wishing joy and happiness
for all in this world♪

386
00:18:20,120 --> 00:18:23,710
♪People laugh and say I'm lost
and foolish♪

